OL,3,GNEWSAAnti-social behaviour prompts new
OL,4,Acar park barrier
OL,5,
OL,6,FA lockable barrier has been installed
OL,7,Fat a car park in Hessle after
OL,8,Fanti-social behaviour (ASB).
OL,10,FDrivers have been congregating in the
OL,11,Fmill car park on Hessle Foreshore in
OL,12,Fthe evenings, playing loud music,
OL,13,Fsounding their horns and leaving
OL,14,Flitter, according to East Riding of
OL,15,FYorkshire Council.
OL,17,FHumberside Police said a Public Space
OL,18,FProtection Order (PSPO) had also been
OL,19,Fput in place to reduce incidents of ASB
OL,20,Fin the area.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
